{"case_id": "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2001年发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：癸酉年、丙辰月、己未日、丙子时。日主己土生于辰月，得月干丙火生扶，身旺。2001年为辛巳年，流年天干辛金为食神，地支巳火为印星。\n\n命主当时8岁（虚岁9岁），处于儿童期。流年辛金食神透出，食神主表达、才艺、口才，且巳火为印星，印主学业、文书、名誉。原局月时两透丙火正印，流年巳火又助印，印星过旺，但辛金食神透出可泄秀，形成“火土金”流通之势，利于展现才华。\n\n原局时柱丙子，子水为偏财，但被丙火盖头，流年巳火与子水无直接作用，但巳火为印，印旺则克制食伤（辛金），但辛金透干，不受地支巳火直接克，反而得辰土生扶，食神有力。食神代表口才、表演，且巳火为印，印主文书、奖状，故有获奖之象。\n\n选项B“参与小话剧演讲比赛获奖”符合食神透干、印星辅助的象，且儿童期此类活动常见。其他选项：A霸凌（七杀无制，但原局无强杀）、C遗传病（病符星未显）、D交通意外（驿马冲动不明显），均不如B贴切。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": null, "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_off", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "singapore_male_19930408_P004-Q17", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_off_r1_g0\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 4625, "response_id": "4d279e42-2b6f-4584-9233-b7aba33bbf09", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 227, "completion_tokens": 337, "total_tokens": 564, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 99}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
